    "text_delta": "tor interview. As I am keen to continue developing my skills—particularly in strategic areas like digital journalism—any guidance the panel can provide on where I can strengthen my profile for future senior editorial roles would be greatly appreciated.\"*\n\n2. **Evaluate the feedback objectively:**  \n   When the feedback arrives, focus on specific areas they identified (e.g., vision for digital news, interview presentation, leadership style).\n\n3. **Check formal guidelines (if applicable):**  \n   If you believe there were genuine procedural irregularities (e.g., questions outside the job specification, failure to follow public broadcaster appointment codes), consult your union representative or HR policy guidelines for the formal review process, keeping the focus entirely on policy and merit.\n",
